00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:04,871
Tota Tales! Today's story:

2
00:00:04,871 --> 00:00:06,569
Yasin and the Window.

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:11,731
Once upon a time, in

4
00:00:11,731 --> 00:00:13,344
a sunny little neighborhood, there

5
00:00:13,344 --> 00:00:15,344
lived a boy named Yasin.

6
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:19,175
Yasin loved football more than anything!

7
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:20,371
One day, he kicked

8
00:00:20,371 --> 00:00:22,022
the ball really hard...

9
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:26,117
Oh no! The ball

10
00:00:26,117 --> 00:00:28,186
