11
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:31,529
Yasin was scared. He thought:

12
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:34,229
Nobody saw me... should I hide?

13
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,163
But then he remembered what Mama

14
00:00:37,163 --> 00:00:39,987
