19
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:52,250
Uncle Fathy smiled and said:

20
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,609
You told the truth, so I'm

21
00:00:54,609 --> 00:00:57,247
not angry. Let's fix it together!

22
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:02,041
So they fixed the window together,

23
00:01:02,041 --> 00:01:04,029
and became the best of friends.

24
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:10,883
Everyone makes mistakes... but brave

25
00:01:10,883 --> 00:01:12,383
